# MicroNest Esports — Platform Rules

## Authority

- The **new platform** (repo root outside `legacy/`) is the only active implementation.
- `legacy/` is **reference-only**. Never import legacy runtime code. Never restore or apply legacy migrations.
- Prefer existing feature-first architecture over broad rewrites. Keep `src/app/` orchestration-only.
- Installed stack: inspect `package.json` / lockfile (Next App Router, React 19, TypeScript strict, Tailwind v4, Supabase SSR). Do not invent versions.
- Package manager: **npm**. No Docker in the current project workflow.

## Safety gates (explicit authorization required)

