- Use project skills under `.agents/skills/` (see `.agents/skills.md`) and personal skills when they materially help.
- Use Google Stitch MCP for one-screen design exploration when relevant; Competitive Arena language stays.
- Never claim a tool, MCP, or skill was used unless it was actually invoked.
